erience the blend of nostalgia and innovation in this engaging VR puzzle journey. The game is still in it's early acces. We will appreciate feedback - and rates :) You can make the game grow!", "short_description": "Embark with us on a journey in Puzzle Match VR! A classic match blocks type game, for the first time in VR. Use your magical wands to crush colorful blocks in a cartoon-styled VR world. Relaxing and intuitive, perfect for all ages, offering a blend of tranquil visuals, engaging puzzles, and a soothing soundtrack."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://crystalapps.eu/puzzlematch-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Crystal Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://crystalapps.eu/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "6938008006313832"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "24785971311090894", "version": "1.2.2"}, "id": "720051300045488", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__type